<title class="- topic/title ">Views</title>
<shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Plugins provide views of components and can be accessed
in many ways. For example, double-click a component in the Nav tree
to see its default view. In addition, you can right-click on a component
and select from its <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Views</uicontrol> menu.</shortdesc>
